# Project core

Repo: **matchy-plus/matchy-plus** (org). Turborepo + pnpm workspaces.

| Package | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `apps/app` | Next.js 16 (App Router) |
| `apps/api` | Fastify 5 REST API |
| `apps/ai` | Flask + Redis Streams worker |
| `packages/database` | Prisma 7 + PostgreSQL |
| `packages/types` | Generated Prisma types |
| `packages/ai-contracts` | Shared AI job contracts |
| `packages/ui` | shadcn/ui + Tailwind |

## Source of truth

Prefer these docs over inventing process:

- `CONTRIBUTING.md`
- `doc/setup/pr-and-merge-flow.md`
- `doc/setup/branch-protection.md`
- `doc/architecture/overview.md`
- `doc/features/*` for feature-area conventions

## Hard constraints

- Do **not** commit secrets (`.env`, tokens, private keys).
- Do **not** push directly to `dev`, `staging`, or `main`.
- Do **not** enable GitHub Actions unless the team explicitly asks (see github-actions rule).
- Feature vertical slices: Prisma → types → service → schemas/routes → app feature (see `doc/practical-workflow-lab.md`).
